Improved Sniper Shot}\cell\row\pard \pard\plain \s3\rtlch\af9\afs24\ab \ltrch\hich\af6\loch\ql\keep\widctlpar\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf18\f6\fs24\b\dbch\af9{\loch
Explanation}
\par \pard\plain \s67\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb180\sa180\ltrpar{\loch
HK, HK. What in the world to do with HK. His default attributes are actually inflated significantly, but almost all of that inflation is in categories which are useless for a droid, primarily strength. Everything else about him, though, is underbaked: he lacks one feat due to the vanilla bug which flips combat and expert droid feat gain; his base vitality is lower than it should be for his class; and he\u8217\'92s a full 11 skill points short of what his total should be!}
\par \pard\plain \s63\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb180\sa180\ltrpar{\loch
This is a thematic mod, not a \u8220\'93make everybody good at what they do\u8221\'94 mod, and HK is where I had to be the most judicious with this. He SHOULD be strong\u8212\'97he doesn\u8217\'92t have human limitations\u8212\'97and as he\u8217\'92s a rusted up old pile of bolts you just soldered back together for the possibly fifth time in as many years, his CON is also probably not that great. Yet at the same time it would be remiss to make HK even less serviceable as a companion.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb180\sa180\ltrpar{\loch
I decided that, like Hanharr, I would treat HK as if he had an inherent racial bonus: a +6 to STR for being a bipedal combat-model droid. It\u8217\'92s realistic that he should be that strong, even if it\u8217\'92s not actively usable for him. Proceeding from here, I allocated some of the extra points that gave to CHA\u8212\'97yes, also useless for a droid, but very fitting for HK, and not just because haha funny; he\u8217\'92s shown to be incredibly charismatic when he unites the HK-51s at the end of the game. One point is left over from HK\u8217\'92s level 4 level-up, and this I allocated to CON as a sort of olive branch; when the player levels him up to level 8, they can at least get him to 12 CON with his next attribute bonus.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb180\sa180\ltrpar{\loch
However, I did what I could elsewhere to make him more serviceable. With his extra feat, I replaced Power Blast with Improved Sniper Shot, which is much more accurate to HK\u8217\'92s behavior as an assassin droid and also synergizes with his lategame unique equipment in TSLRCM. I also put his base vitality back where it should be so he has more health than he would in vanilla even without additional CON, and improved all of his skills, but with special focus on Repair so he can more easily keep himself in the fight.}
