Explanation}
\par \pard\plain \s67\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb180\sa180\ltrpar{\loch
Canderous is a bit of another casualty of the thematic nature of this mod. He talks about his body slowing down and his process of getting more introspective in his old age, and while his stat line here sort of reflects that, it\u8217\'92s not perfect. Canderous in KOTOR, before the confrontation with Jagi and his doubts about the future of the Mandalorians and his own personal lust for war, has more WIS than he does now! His CON also increased between games, despite talking about how much he\u8217\'92s starting to rely on his implants!}
\par \pard\plain \s63\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb180\sa180\ltrpar{\loch
To simulate his aging, I took his CON down by 1 level and applied the overage to WIS. He also has two more feats than he should have, one of which I used on removing Toughness, to further represent his problems\u8212\'97perceived or real\u8212\'97with his aging. The other was a reduction of Weapon Specialization: Blaster Rifle to Weapon Focus, just to make the feat count proper.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb180\sa180\ltrpar{\loch
Finally, just for some basic consistency, I gave him the same starting demolition skill he had in the original game.}
